// zm_zz_devmenu_anims - list of AI animations for the zm_zz_devmenu dev menu (Kronos).
// Generated from the animations that are always loaded in a Zombies match
// (ingame_zm, global, global_shared_mp, ingame_shared_mp). 660 animations.
// Kept in its own file: if it ever fails to load, the menu still works without it.
// Note: acts cannot compile %"anim" written directly inside a call, so each one is assigned.

autoexec zm_dm_anims_init()
